mbat feels smoother, the build variety is massive, and there are secrets everywhere that make exploring and replaying worlds worth your time. Co-op is just as fun as ever and experimenting with different archetypes keeps every playthrough feeling fresh. The main story still isn't the strongest part of the game but just like the first one, the gameplay is what keeps me coming back. If you enjoyed Remnant: From the Ashes, this is an easy recommendation and a sequel that absolutely lives up to the original.", "timestamp_created": 1782845679, "timestamp_updated": 1782845679, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.60000002384185791", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229264594", "author": {"steamid": "76561199490816589", "personaname": "DarkSide420", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199490816589/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 17903, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1040, "playtime_at_review": 16177, "deck_playtime_at_review": 15418, "last_played": 1789221942, "avatar": "5076cb4b31180b9fb9b6520693e7906f4c89b8ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game love it. They need to add more DLC and make another one", "timestamp_created": 1782844449, "timestamp_updated": 1782844449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229257977", "author": {"steamid": "76561199207927451", "personaname": "zeodemon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199207